; ZacOS 9 Views 9: the Finder's icon-label and list font in ZacOS 9.
;
; An original design. Its metrics follow the Mac OS 8 Finder's views font
; as measured in HIG figure 2-24 (docs/reference/zacos9-fonts.md): cap
; height 8, x-height 6, 1 px strokes, 1 px after each letter, 3 px space.
; The letter shapes are drawn from scratch. The italic style (alias names)
; is synthesised from these glyphs, as QuickDraw did.
;
; Format: see platinum-system-12.pfont.

font ZacOS 9 Views
height 15
baseline 11
cap 8
xheight 6
accent-gap 1

char space 3 0

